  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Makueni County Government-Completion of Makueni Fruit Processing Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The county intends to acquire a fruit juice reconstitution line  to convert puree to Juice and basically contribute to value addition of fruits produced in the county in order to improve the economic well being of its farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
